From: The PonWrt Authors
Subject: [PATCH] tls: add AN7581 EIP93 AES-GCM rustls provider

Use cryptodev with verified EIP93 selection, then AF_ALG, then ring software.
Keep TLS framing, authentication failures and cipher negotiation compatible
with rustls 0.23.27. Restrict activation to AN7581/EN7581 without CPU AES.
Reuse per-key record and transport buffers; clear only each record's used
region. Both kernel interfaces share an 8192-byte plaintext threshold.
Device detection and backend selection are automatic in the server.
QUARK_EIP93=auto|devcrypto|afalg|off remains a direct-run diagnostic override.

